{"seq":1,"slug":"multidisciplinary-mental-models","title":"多元思维模型","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/charlie-munger/core-contributions/multidisciplinary-mental-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-latticework-of-models","title":"思维模型的格栅","url":"/c/people/charlie-munger/core-contributions/multidisciplinary-mental-models/the-latticework-of-models","wordCount":1813,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"worldly-wisdom","title":"普世智慧","url":"/c/people/charlie-munger/core-contributions/multidisciplinary-mental-models/worldly-wisdom","wordCount":1673,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 多元思维模型\n\n本章阐述查理·芒格最具标志性的思想——\"多元思维模型\"与\"普世智慧\"。芒格主张，人们应当在头脑中建立一个由各学科重要原理构成的\"思维格栅\"，并学会将现实问题挂靠到这些模型之上，从而避免\"手里只有锤子\"式的片面思维。这种融会贯通多个学科的整体性智慧，正是芒格所追求的\"普世智慧\"。本章呈现的，是芒格思想体系中最为根本、最具原创性的认知方法。\n"}